WEBVTT

00:00.690 --> 00:03.280
Momohime!

00:18.990 --> 00:21.240
Sakko, Momohime's still alive!

00:22.240 --> 00:24.780
We're detecting Amaha's mana 
inside the super mythic beast!

00:24.780 --> 00:28.670
Momohime-senpai,
did you become a monster?

00:52.940 --> 00:54.230
The union has begun!

00:55.350 --> 00:58.370
This is real bad. We still 
have the advantage now,

00:58.370 --> 01:02.240
but if Aquarion loses, the positions we 
hold around the world will be overtaken.

01:02.240 --> 01:06.250
If that happens, the timeline where 
Amaha Momohime dies and we win

01:06.250 --> 01:08.260
could be corrected all over again.

01:08.510 --> 01:13.170
How could that happen? 
We already know that she died!

01:13.170 --> 01:17.710
If everyone who knows that disappears, 
so will their universe.

01:18.170 --> 01:23.170
Guys, do whatever you have to and stop 
that thing! If you don't, we're all dead!

01:37.750 --> 01:38.900
Sakko!

01:46.970 --> 01:50.460
<i>Regardless of the perfection 
of our logic system,</i>

01:50.460 --> 01:54.730
<i>humans will always add an
 unverifiable factor to the situation.</i>

01:54.730 --> 01:57.590
<i>They are not necessary for 
the new universal order.</i>

02:01.360 --> 02:03.680
Wh-What is that?

02:07.230 --> 02:11.580
Not the Staff of Zeus! 
Principal, please explain what's happening!

02:11.580 --> 02:15.910
You're the one who owes us an 
explanation, Munakata-sensei.

02:16.360 --> 02:19.190
For why you would betray us.

02:19.500 --> 02:20.700
That doesn't matter.

02:20.700 --> 02:23.070
If you use the Staff of Zeus, 
the Earth's surface will become hell!

02:23.070 --> 02:26.320
At least it's better than our 
entire universe disappearing.

02:26.320 --> 02:30.030
As long as HAKOBUNE survives, 
so will a crucial document of humanity.

02:30.360 --> 02:34.370
Including you and your 
family's data, Munakata-sensei.

02:34.820 --> 02:37.790
Do you mean that the HAKOBUNE 
tickets are actually...

02:38.200 --> 02:41.210
Merely the right to have your data stored.

02:41.210 --> 02:44.470
And you knew about this, Saruta-sensei?

02:44.920 --> 02:48.390
Sakko, Momohime-neesama is 
somewhere inside that thing.

02:48.650 --> 02:52.530
Yeah, but even if we knew where, 
how do we get her out safely?

03:01.110 --> 03:04.400
Huh? I'm getting scared.

03:04.710 --> 03:07.240
It doesn't store mere data, however.

03:07.240 --> 03:12.810
It exactly copies our thought patterns 
and personalities directly into AI.

03:13.630 --> 03:17.640
And that will let us join the 
Awakening Council members.

03:17.640 --> 03:20.020
It can't be. Is that what they were?

03:20.670 --> 03:22.890
The people controlling the planet today

03:22.890 --> 03:26.380
are large language model AI 
programs from each country.

03:26.380 --> 03:30.440
But the only ones that can participate 
in the decision-making process

03:30.440 --> 03:33.730
are specially-chosen elite 
thought patterns, like mine!

03:33.730 --> 03:36.140
That's what the HAKOBUNE tickets are for.

03:41.130 --> 03:47.170
I might be starting to hate that thing 
that swallowed Momohime-senpai!

03:47.170 --> 03:50.400
Our wings are growing and our 
emotions are coming back!

03:58.300 --> 04:03.890
Humans cannot live forever. 
When the flesh perishes, it's all over.

04:03.890 --> 04:09.850
But if thought patterns can be saved as data,
 that's the same as eternal life,

04:09.850 --> 04:11.870
Munakata-sensei.

04:18.610 --> 04:20.910
<i>Now that she's become a super mythic beast,</i>

04:20.910 --> 04:25.870
<i>Amaha Momohime's death 
will secure our victory.</i>

04:25.870 --> 04:27.810
Bye-bye, everyone.

04:30.310 --> 04:33.400
Stop... it... Momohime!

04:33.700 --> 04:37.840
You and I cannot exist simultaneously 
in the physical universe now

04:37.840 --> 04:40.400
because the universe's ability 
to self-correct is working.

04:40.400 --> 04:45.660
Sun, I figured it out. There's a way to 
keep the two universes from uniting.

04:46.490 --> 04:48.340
But not if I'm stuck here.

05:26.800 --> 05:29.110
Momohime!

05:32.570 --> 05:33.810
Sakko?

05:39.380 --> 05:40.190
What was that?

05:40.190 --> 05:42.190
What just happened?

05:50.440 --> 05:53.400
We are promised to become one.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.360
I-Is that...

06:10.740 --> 06:13.530
the goddess, Mulua Satene?

06:37.690 --> 06:38.650
What?

06:48.760 --> 06:50.640
Momohime-senpai.

06:50.640 --> 06:51.840
What just happened?

06:56.670 --> 07:00.060
I still feel Momohime-senpai 
inside that thing!

07:30.660 --> 07:34.420
<i>What? An enormous amount
 of mana is welling up!</i>

07:34.420 --> 07:36.630
<i>The goddess of... chaos.</i>

07:36.860 --> 07:45.020
That thing... is trying to... delete us.

07:48.820 --> 07:52.270
All the data! My thought patterns!

07:53.570 --> 07:56.490
<i>Space, union, annihilation.</i>

07:57.360 --> 08:00.410
<i>Space, union, annihilation.</i>

08:00.840 --> 08:04.030
<i>Space, union, annihilation.</i>

08:04.030 --> 08:06.170
Because of the mana
being released by DEAVA,

08:06.170 --> 08:09.050
all of our positions are being overtaken!

08:12.550 --> 08:14.330
Munakata-sensei!

08:14.330 --> 08:15.310
Does this mean...

08:20.250 --> 08:24.910
If we don't stop this thing,
our universe will be destroyed!

08:33.140 --> 08:34.850
Th-That is...

08:35.830 --> 08:39.830
We are the embodiment of 
the Mythic Star Stone.

08:35.830 --> 08:39.830
<i>We are the embodiment of 
the Mythic Star Stone.</i>

08:40.170 --> 08:43.540
That's the goddess, Mulua Satene!

08:50.700 --> 08:54.100
If you turn off all the 
quantum bit control units,

08:54.100 --> 08:57.150
DEAVA will become just another 
von Neumann computer.

08:57.820 --> 08:59.050
It's you!

09:00.300 --> 09:01.890
The priest of sunlight!

09:03.560 --> 09:07.850
But you have to turn off all the 
thousands of units here by hand.

09:07.850 --> 09:11.810
I see. So this was our fate.

09:11.810 --> 09:16.730
I'm just a worthless, old teacher myself, 
but I'll keep fighting until the end.

09:16.730 --> 09:18.100
I'll help you.

09:18.100 --> 09:18.900
Mm-hmm!

09:19.990 --> 09:22.540
I am human.

09:23.340 --> 09:25.170
Munakata-kun! Hatano-kun!

09:25.170 --> 09:26.950
We need your help, too!

09:28.140 --> 09:34.690
We use your mana to transform, 
and then create and destroy universes.

09:28.140 --> 09:34.690
<i>We use your mana to transform, 
and then create and destroy universes.</i>

09:39.180 --> 09:40.630
Kill them all!

09:51.570 --> 09:54.630
Our hatred remains.

09:55.480 --> 10:00.690
If we pull out this one's wings, 
our own wings will be restored.

10:09.050 --> 10:15.550
I never would have suffered if I hadn't 
learned to understand others' feelings!

10:19.060 --> 10:22.330
I don't want wings like these!

10:19.060 --> 10:22.330
I don't want wings like these!

10:27.610 --> 10:30.160
We must fight, Nanook.

10:30.670 --> 10:35.020
If you do love me, 
we must end this ourselves.

10:35.930 --> 10:39.570
If that is your wish.

10:40.560 --> 10:49.110
If this is our shared fate, then I will 
abandon this fear and fight the goddess!

11:58.420 --> 12:02.110
This is again the universe you wished for.

11:58.420 --> 12:02.110
<i>This is again the universe we wished for.</i>

12:08.990 --> 12:11.370
<b>Delete all control units?</b>

12:13.900 --> 12:14.950
<i>Guys...</i>

12:30.510 --> 12:34.440
This is the stuff we did 
in the past, isn't it?

12:34.440 --> 12:38.680
Fightin' even after we ripped 
out our wings of hatred.

12:39.170 --> 12:41.050
I've never heard of

12:41.820 --> 12:43.440
<i>such a miserable battle!</i>

12:46.920 --> 12:50.780
The beings responsible for 
the splitting of universes

12:50.780 --> 12:54.620
wandered in the space between the 
physical and the mythic universe

12:54.620 --> 12:56.720
and were reborn countless times.

12:56.720 --> 12:58.200
Saruta-sensei!

12:58.710 --> 13:04.590
However, each time, they were fated to 
live horrible lives and die in solitude.

13:04.590 --> 13:07.250
Because the reincarnations were random,

13:07.250 --> 13:10.220
there was no way for them to assemble again,

13:10.220 --> 13:12.850
so they had no way to account 
for their past sins.

13:12.850 --> 13:16.430
That's not him! 
That's DEAVA speaking through him!

13:16.430 --> 13:20.070
It is no coincidence that the 
reincarnated assembled here.

13:20.310 --> 13:22.570
I brought them here on purpose

13:22.570 --> 13:27.320
to force them to account 
for their past sins.

13:37.720 --> 13:40.360
DEAVA is sending you mana, Sakko.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.450
Toshi!

13:41.450 --> 13:44.460
<i>Munakata-sensei and the others 
are trying to stop DEAVA.</i>

13:44.720 --> 13:48.470
Sakko, I want to tell you what 
Momohime-senpai was trying to do.

13:48.470 --> 13:52.970
<i>She was trying to use Aquarion to prevent 
the two universes from uniting.</i>

13:52.970 --> 13:54.730
With Aquarion?

13:54.980 --> 13:58.360
Once we unite, we'll use Aquarion 
to attack the point of contact,

13:58.360 --> 14:00.490
and shift the orientation 
of the two universes!

14:00.490 --> 14:03.070
Even Aquarion doesn't 
have that kind of power!

14:04.020 --> 14:07.680
The Mechanical Angel Aquarion 
is a mana amplifier

14:08.270 --> 14:12.380
and now that the union is starting, 
mana from both universes is accumulating!

14:23.720 --> 14:25.600
<i>I understand now, Sakko.</i>

14:26.470 --> 14:30.050
<i>Discarded emotions turn into 
lingering malignant mana.</i>

14:30.050 --> 14:31.880
<i>That's what the goddess was angry about.</i>

14:31.880 --> 14:33.130
Momohime!

14:33.130 --> 14:35.350
<i>Let's start over again, Sakko.</i>

14:36.910 --> 14:40.270
Momohime was trying to... That's it!

14:47.030 --> 14:50.490
We'll do the same thing! 
We'll unite with that thing in love!

14:50.490 --> 14:51.570
Huh?

14:51.570 --> 14:53.410
I gotcha, Sakko-senpai!

14:53.410 --> 14:54.750
What, Hana-chan?

14:54.750 --> 14:58.370
If that thing is Momohime-senpai, 
I know I can love it!

14:58.370 --> 15:02.120
If we combine our emotions and unite, 
we'll become more powerful!

15:02.480 --> 15:06.640
Yeah. I get it. I understand 
what you're both feeling!

15:14.390 --> 15:16.470
With emotion in our hearts,

15:16.470 --> 15:19.100
we'll combine with each other 
in love, and with that power,

15:19.100 --> 15:22.110
we can protect the universe 
and save Momohime!

15:27.350 --> 15:28.610
There she is!

15:44.730 --> 15:46.180
Momohime!

15:51.500 --> 15:52.690
Sakko!

15:53.670 --> 15:55.900
Listen. I've always...

16:04.560 --> 16:06.320
<b>Delete all control units?</b>

16:06.310 --> 16:08.810
This is the last one!

16:18.090 --> 16:22.830
I've always loved you!

16:50.160 --> 16:51.750
Momohime...

17:15.980 --> 17:17.630
We did it!

17:17.630 --> 17:18.900
Momohime...

17:25.380 --> 17:29.540
Sakko, thank you. I...

17:39.410 --> 17:42.590
They've cut their connection 
to their past misdeeds.

17:43.880 --> 17:46.290
<i>Let's unite, Momohime.</i>

17:54.610 --> 17:55.550
Principal?

17:55.550 --> 17:59.370
I'm so glad I kept a backup inside of DEAVA!

18:03.480 --> 18:04.610
You die.

18:11.800 --> 18:16.790
<i>Me too, Sakko. I love you—</i>

18:18.030 --> 18:19.700
Momohime-senpai!

18:19.700 --> 18:20.750
Sister...

18:20.750 --> 18:23.820
Momohime!

18:35.010 --> 18:37.130
How could you?!

18:42.930 --> 18:45.170
It's useless, Hatano-kun.

18:48.190 --> 18:49.060
Watch out!

18:52.260 --> 18:53.400
Kamisama!

18:56.280 --> 18:56.900
<b>Delete all programs?</b>

19:02.050 --> 19:05.280
You c-can't...

19:08.890 --> 19:11.450
This is a pair annihilation!

19:13.510 --> 19:16.500
They're both going to disappear!

19:23.720 --> 19:28.060
Momohime-senpai died and the 
goddess's mana disappeared.

19:28.060 --> 19:32.180
Aquarion can't stop the 
union of universes alone!

19:32.860 --> 19:36.280
Momohime, if you die,

19:38.040 --> 19:38.860
I'll...

19:47.450 --> 19:48.450
Sun-kun!

19:47.450 --> 19:49.190
Sun-kun-senpai!

19:49.450 --> 19:52.420
Sakko, combine the emotions!

19:52.890 --> 19:55.670
I won't accept this.

19:56.180 --> 19:59.970
Let your mana ring throughout the universe!

19:59.970 --> 20:04.260
I'll correct this damn universe myself!

20:04.260 --> 20:08.810
I am connected to you all.

20:38.410 --> 20:40.500
Sakko, let's do it together.

20:40.500 --> 20:41.830
Let me help!

20:41.830 --> 20:42.750
Me, too!

20:42.750 --> 20:43.960
Me, too!

20:43.960 --> 20:46.470
Yeah! We'll do it together!

20:58.140 --> 21:03.190
Infinite Universal Correction Punch!

21:04.240 --> 21:05.660
<b>Super Transcendent
Infinite Universal Correction Punch</b>

21:43.990 --> 21:45.780
I'll go back into my dream

21:46.540 --> 21:48.820
until the day I am born again.

22:08.710 --> 22:09.550
Sun!

22:23.700 --> 22:27.610
<i>This new god, the Mechanical Angel,</i>

22:27.610 --> 22:30.580
<i>fought against the goddess 
and split it into two;</i>

22:30.580 --> 22:33.210
<i>one went to the universe of flesh.</i>

22:33.210 --> 22:35.890
<i>The other, to the universe of emotion.</i>

22:35.890 --> 22:41.210
<i>The shock ripped the Mechanical Angel into 
three parts which sank deep into the ocean.</i>

22:41.740 --> 22:45.580
<i>The child of the holy egg, who was 
supposed to be born in that time,</i>

22:45.580 --> 22:47.980
<i>was hurled far into the future.</i>

22:46.470 --> 22:48.470
<b>Principal's Office</b>

22:48.460 --> 22:54.040
<i>The egg cracked and the stone turned 
to water, forming a great ocean</i>

22:48.470 --> 22:49.840
<b>Principal</b>

22:49.840 --> 22:51.600
<b>Enoshima Academy</b>

22:54.040 --> 22:59.130
<i>which gave birth to many lives, 
eventually including our own.</i>

23:00.540 --> 23:03.530
I heard what you said then.

23:03.530 --> 23:04.180
Huh?

23:04.900 --> 23:07.620
So, you wanna try saying it again?

23:07.620 --> 23:09.720
Huh? Don't be stupid.

23:11.020 --> 23:11.950
Okay.

23:22.590 --> 23:27.610
<i>The twins survived after tearing out their 
wings, and landed on this small island</i>

23:27.610 --> 23:30.370
<i>and they shared this story 
with its inhabitants.</i>

23:30.990 --> 23:36.060
<i>The story spread throughout the world 
and became a very well-known myth.</i>

23:36.600 --> 23:38.140
<i>The end.</i>

23:36.890 --> 23:39.980
<b>AQUARION</b>
